      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254805/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix zucchini, eggs, vegetable oil, onion powder, and salt together in a bowl. Stir in potato flakes and baking powder; mix until batter is combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jueCHaefMnzdYYW6Rswfw719xnM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-254805-zucchini-waffles-green-waffles-VAT-step-02-2cdddf844c264bda9d711b88a1e302c6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/254805/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour 1/2 cup of the batter onto the center of the waffle iron. Close the lid; cook until iron stops steaming and waffle is crisp, about 5 minutes.",
